  "toolName": "complete_task",
  "inputArgs": "{\"description\":\"Explore project context - understand the extension's value proposition, target audience, and key differentiators\",\"result\":\"Explored project context:\\n\\n**Key Findings**:\\n1. **Target Audience**: Blinkit backend/frontend engineers working on SDUI JSON payloads\\n2. **Core Value Props**:\\n   - 55x faster development loop (55s → <1s) via hot-reload\\n   - 15-30% payload weight reduction via unused key detection\\n   - 85%+ jank prediction accuracy before deployment\\n   - Zero build cycles for JSON testing\\n\\n3. **Unique Differentiators**:\\n   - Live device integration (scrcpy mirror + TCP hot-reload)\\n   - Empirical performance model (144 widget types × 12 profiles)\\n   - Network traffic capture from production\\n   - Visual preview with heat maps\\n\\n4. **Pain Points Solved**:\\n   - Dead payload weight (Type A & B waste)\\n   - Performance blindness\\n   - Color/icon token memorization\\n   - Manual deeplink testing\\n   - Build-deploy-test cycles\\n\\n5. **Comparable Tools**: None - this is a custom internal tool with no direct competitors in the market\"}",
